title: AskJobStart
---
<<declare $firstTime = true>>
<<if $firstTime == true>>
    <<set $firstTime to false>>
    <<jump FirstAsk>>
<<else>>
    <<jump SorryAdvancedQuestions>>
<<endif>>

===

title: FirstAsk
---
MuseumDirector: Welcome to the Museum.
MuseumDirector: How can I help you?
Fred: I'm Fred Donnitoly, and I'm here for the job
MuseumDirector: Do you really want to work here?
Fred: yeah I'm very enthusiastic.
MuseumDirector: ok, do you like the history?
Fred: Uhm sure.
Fred: I don't LIKE the history. I LOVE the history.
MuseumDirector: that sounds good.
MuseumDirector: Mr. Donnitoly. Do you know in what year stated the first world war?
Fred: ehh
-> 1985
-> 1200
-> I know it, it just that I dont want to say it.
MuseumDirector: what I though, you know nothing about history. 
MuseumDirector: Sorry Mr Donnitoly I can't give you the job.
<<jump SorryAdvancedQuestions>>
===

title: SorryAdvancedQuestions
---
Fred: Can we try the questions again?
MuseumDirector: My questions are too advanced for you. And excuse me I'm very busy right now.
Fred: Ok, bye
MuseumDirector: bye.
